  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with this Custom Camo Football Player Comforter from Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this high-quality bedding features a distinctive camo design of a football player running on a flag, bringing athletic energy and personal style straight to your space. Fully customizable with options to add your own name and number, it makes an exceptionally thoughtful gift for boys, teens, and sports lovers of all ages.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Supports customization options with 2 text inputs for adding a name and number of your choice.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy &amp; Soft Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Artwork:</strong> Features a graphic illustration of an American football player running on a camouflage flag with stars and stripes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Product Options:</strong> Available as either a lightweight duvet cover (without filling) or an all-in-one thick comforter set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Comes in standard US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, quick drying, and designed to prevent fading.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Camo Football Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Camouflage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
